{"version":1,"content":"<p>有「翻版范冰冰」之稱的2023年香港小姐季軍王敏慈，自當選後選擇暫別香港演藝圈，返回北京中央戲劇學院完成學業，事實證明其決定相當明智。</p><p>求學期間她已片約不斷，先後參演《雨霖鈴》、《諜報上不封頂》及《閃耀如她》等重頭劇，與楊洋、肖戰等一線男星合</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T10:12:06.261555+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T10:01:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T10:05:25.270990+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T10:05:25.270990+00:00","content_hash":"d9d2ab2a78845d4c76c939ee2b0d6c70c85100aa47a894029c05a30540f4a31e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}